      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING BABE (1) was in traffic last time here and fell. Rates strongly on best and well worth another try. BABA VOSS (2) is having his first look at this circuit. Comes here after a last start 4th and beaten 7 lengths (30.36) at Wentworth Park. The form out of last race has been strong. Warrants plenty of respect. FORTY'S BOY (3) doesn't have the best strike-rate. Finished third (30.22) at this track latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Has a good record at this journey. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Will give a great sight again. PAX BOSTONIA (7) comes into calculations after placing most recently.",
